+bidirectional proposition transport. `intake.json` binds the exact member and
+Stage6 alias; `statement-crosswalk.json` binds the source and target semantic
+surface; `proof-units.json` and `readability-review.json` provide the typed DAG
+and total reverse ledger; `machine-closure.json` records the trust-zero identity
+transport; and the receipts carry the current trace and provisional release.
